    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Dead-letter queue \u2014 by reason, and the durable total",
      "description": "Jobs permanently given up on in the selected window, split by reason. The only queue here that represents real loss -- every other depth drains on its own; nothing drains this one.\n\n*** increase() AND NOT A RAW COUNTER SUM, AND THE FIRST VERSION OF THIS PANEL GOT IT WRONG. ***\n\nA Prometheus counter lives in the process that owns it. Kill a pod and its series DISAPPEARS; the replacement starts a new series at zero. So sum(counter) across pods is NOT monotonic when the pod set changes -- and this panel was drawing DESCENDING dead-letter lines after the chaos test killed workers, which is impossible for a quantity that only ever grows.\n\nMeasured: the raw sum read 5 while the dead-letter queue actually held 7. increase() is reset-aware and handles a vanished series correctly.\n\nSplit by reason because the three mean different things and different people fix them: UNPARSEABLE is a bug in OUR serialisation, NON_RETRIABLE_RESPONSE is the subscriber rejecting us outright, RETRIES_EXHAUSTED is a subscriber that was down too long. Safe as a label because DlqReason is a 3-constant enum -- bounded by our source, not by anything a caller supplies.\n\nFor the CURRENT depth use the 'DLQ depth now' tile: it reads Redis directly and is the durable truth.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (increase(webhook_dlq_entries_total[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}} (this window)",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "max(webhook_dlq_depth)",
          "legendFormat": "total in queue (durable)",
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
